{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ex0nuxc3","slide":2,"text":"Many covariant Lagrangians generate higher-time-derivative FLRW equations.","textPreview":"Many covariant Lagrangians generate higher-time-derivative FLRW equations.","textChars":74,"textLines":1,"bbox":[100,246,492,44]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3itgfmlk","slide":2,"text":"•","textPreview":"•","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,295,24,36]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bm58z25k","slide":2,"text":"Many surviving branches fail numerically or violate the Friedmann constraint.","textPreview":"Many surviving branches fail numerically or violate the Friedmann constraint.","textChars":77,"textLines":1,"bbox":[100,294,492,44]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m1cfa9w3","slide":2,"text":"•","textPreview":"•","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,343,24,36]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tsvu9kni","slide":2,"text":"A visually elegant operator list is not useful unless it fits real DES-SN + DESI BAO data.","textPreview":"A visually elegant operator list is not useful unless it fits real DES-SN + DESI BAO data.","textChars":90,"textLines":1,"bbox":[100,342,492,44]}
