{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mp0bi9s3","slide":2,"text":"Find models that are simultaneously legal, runnable, constraint-preserving, and competitive in χ².","textPreview":"Find models that are simultaneously legal, runnable, constraint-preserving, and competitive in χ².","textChars":98,"textLines":1,"bbox":[722,276,346,120]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tgfmlkjm","slide":2,"text":"The LLM is a proposal policy. The physics pipeline is the judge.","textPreview":"The LLM is a proposal policy. The physics pipeline is the judge.","textChars":64,"textLines":1,"bbox":[722,436,340,44]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/9ptjbr","slide":2,"text":"This slide should make the setup approachable: the task is not asking an LLM to invent physics by itself; it is steering a hard validation pipeline through a large search space."}
