{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0bi9s36h","slide":16,"text":"The deliberately non-EH new-physics sector is much harder, but it produces repeated, runnable curvature-coupled branches.","textPreview":"The deliberately non-EH new-physics sector is much harder, but it produces repeated, runnable curvature-coupled branches.","textChars":121,"textLines":1,"bbox":[160,326,900,72]}
